  "contract": [
    "Keep both wear decisions in C, preserving original optical/history thresholds, wrapping counters, live provider/state reads, log arguments, register/unregister timing and mode changes.",
    "Use ordinary C greater-than2000 and less-than40 comparisons with the established GCC9 strict signaling/rounding/trapping flags. Compiled helpers emit native signaling VCMPE and preserve exact FPSCR effects for quiet/signaling NaNs, flushed subnormals and preset flags.",
    "Wear-off reuses r1_native_float_to_signed32 rather than a second conversion body. The conversion executes before logging decisions even when logging is disabled, preserving result/FPSCR effects after provider mutation."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "All774 native decision instruction bytes execute in the full parent corpora. Direct tests compare state and write width/order/value, provider arguments/snapshots, logical invalid accesses and full FPSCR. The actual C range provider is included.",
    "The1688-case motion pipeline executes actual C coordination, statistics, both decisions, range and conversion. Clear/multicast/tick/register/unregister/log providers remain modeled. Source execution cannot enter stock code; modeled calls return through BX LR stubs.",
    "The focused131712 comparisons execute the actual compiled static helpers against the native VCMPE instruction and an independent NZCV predicate, across2058 binary32 patterns and32 FPSCR configurations.",
    "Cortex-M4 is selected explicitly. FP context is initialized before assigning FPSCR; cold-FPU/task-context activation, physical execution and concurrency remain unproven.",
    "Saved integer/FP registers, SP, masks and guards checked on normal return. Caller scratch, APSR, void return values, fault PC and private frames excluded. The pipeline compares public state and modeled boundary arguments rather than private scratch addresses.",
    "The two manifest units switch from Clang to the existing license-free GCC9 FP profile; all other nongenerated objects, existing conversion/range/statistics bodies and writable state remain unchanged. No new imports or RAM ownership.",
    "Final executable linking/startup, remaining hardware dependencies, sensor delivery and boot remain open. Relocatable composition is not bootable firmware; instruction or image identity is not claimed."
  ],
